                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v10.1"&gt;ILSpy 10.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning"&gt;&lt;p class="markdown-alert-title"&gt;&lt;svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-alert mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M6.457 1.047c.659-1.234 2.427-1.234 3.086 0l6.082 11.378A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.082 15H1.918a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.543-2.575Zm1.763.707a.25.25 0 0 0-.44 0L1.698 13.132a.25.25 0 0 0 .22.368h12.164a.25.25 0 0 0 .22-.368Zm.53 3.996v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 11a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Warning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We DO NOT own the domain ilspy[.]org&lt;/strong&gt; See &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4211773802" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3709" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3709/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3709"&gt;#3709&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Download ILSpy only from GitHub Releases!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release is based on &lt;a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/10.0" rel="nofollow"&gt;.NET 10.0&lt;/a&gt;. Please make sure that you have it installed on your machine beforehand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;New Language Features&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;.NET 11: &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/main/docs/design/specs/runtime-async.md"&gt;runtime-async&lt;/a&gt; support. See also &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/main/release-notes/11.0/preview/preview4/runtime.md#runtime-libraries-are-now-compiled-with-runtime-async"&gt;Runtime libraries are now compiled with runtime-async&lt;/a&gt;. Implemented via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4401821484" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3731" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3731/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3731"&gt;#3731&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4392448005" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3730" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3730/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3730"&gt;#3730&lt;/a&gt;: List/extract embedded resources, decompile BAML to XAML in ilspycmd. This was added to address existing workarounds for decompilation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4408733897" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3732" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3732/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3732"&gt;#3732&lt;/a&gt;: Reduce build warnings: lift IDisposable, fix CS9336 precedence bug, dispose evicted assemblies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Bug fixes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4437655731" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3734" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3734/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3734"&gt;#3734&lt;/a&gt;: Search pane flickers when navigating to search result in large assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4189393404" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3705" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3705/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3705"&gt;#3705&lt;/a&gt;: Code window is empty when select a .baml and refresh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a full list of changes click &lt;a href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/compare/v10.0.1...v10.1"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
